GhosttyKit for Orbe

This archive is built from Ghostty (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty)
for Orbe (https://github.com/nakashima-takeo/orbe) by the packaging in the
orbe/ directory of https://github.com/nakashima-takeo/ghostty. It contains
the third-party software listed below. Each component remains under its own
license; full texts are in licenses/.

