Fonts (fonts/*.ttf, and fonts embedded in GhosttyKit.xcframework)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* JetBrains Mono Nerd Font — OFL-1.1
  Included unmodified in fonts/ as
  JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-{Regular,Bold,Italic,BoldItalic}.ttf. The glyphs added
  by the Nerd Fonts patch come from the icon sets described under Symbols Nerd
  Font.
  https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono, https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
  License: licenses/jetbrains-mono-OFL.txt

* JetBrains Mono — OFL-1.1
  Embedded unmodified in GhosttyKit.xcframework by libghostty as its built-in
  fallback typeface.
  https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
  License: licenses/jetbrains-mono-OFL.txt

* Symbols Nerd Font — composite (MIT License plus the licenses of the icon
  sets it collects)
  Embedded unmodified in GhosttyKit.xcframework by libghostty as its symbol
  fallback. The font collects glyphs from several icon sets, each under its
  own license; two of them are under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), which requires attribution:
  Font Awesome (Fonticons, Inc.) and Codicons (Microsoft). The upstream
  license audit (license-audit.md in the Nerd Fonts repository) lists all of
  them.
  https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
  License: licenses/nerd-fonts-symbols-only-LICENSE.txt

  Fonts that declare a Reserved Font Name are included unmodified under their
  own names.
